{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-03-03 08:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE SETS THE DATE FOR ITS THIRD QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2022 EARNINGS ANNOUNCEMENT', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS, MARCH 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ORACLE CORPORATION TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS THIRD QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2022 RESULTS WILL BE RELEASED ON THURSDAY, MARCH 10TH, AFTER THE CLOSE OF THE MARKET.\xa0 ORACLE WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL AND LIVE WEBCAST AT 4:00 P.M.'}